{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/eb9lfibaf8fpouyw0x3vh63st","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"eb9lfibaf8fpouyw0x3vh63st","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/eb9lfibaf8fpouyw0x3vh63st","published_at":"2026-11-24T19:06:54Z","ref":"A1","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","summary":"研究者引述案例称，GPT-6.2 Astra 仅用 22 分钟和公开资料，将耶鲁 Beinecke 图书馆藏的 1808 年蒙特利尔至苏必利尔湖匿名素描画作者鉴定为 vicomte de Chabot，并找到其微缩胶片日记供验证。日记笔迹与素描题注吻合，1808 年 6 月 18 日日记明确写下“我画了一幅素描”；作者认为这标志着模型的研究发现能力正从数学等可验证领域扩展到历史等非确定性领域。","title":"GPT-6.2 Astra 用 22 分钟破解 1808 年素描画作者之谜","title_en":"GPT-6.2 Astra for solving a significant historical mystery:","url":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2125305172721320165"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/nm8mi41auemid3iivue4tel3d","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"nm8mi41auemid3iivue4tel3d","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/nm8mi41auemid3iivue4tel3d","published_at":"2026-11-24T18:32:13Z","ref":"A2","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"X：Philipp Schmid（Google DeepMind 开发者体验） (@_philschmid)","summary":"Philipp Schmid 宣布 Google Workspace MCP servers 与 gwscli 正式 GA，新增 Personal 模式一键开通，无需 Enterprise 计划或绑卡。共 8 个 server 覆盖 Gmail、Drive、Docs、Sheets、Slides、Calendar、Chat、Tasks，免费档为每产品每天 5,000 次请求，发送和分享内置 HITL 确认。他提到仍需经过 Google Cloud，但比旧的 OAuth 同意屏和应用审核流程好得多，欢迎试用反馈。","title":"Google Workspace MCP servers 与 gwscli 正式发布，Personal 模式一键开通","title_en":"Google Workspace MCP servers and gwscli are GA today. No Enterprise plan or billing card needed with the new 1-click Personal mode setup.","url":"https://x.com/_philschmid/status/2125296446459056156"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/jurm0kx9gczvzp4o14g0o35xo","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"jurm0kx9gczvzp4o14g0o35xo","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/jurm0kx9gczvzp4o14g0o35xo","published_at":"2026-11-24T18:30:42Z","ref":"A3","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"Anthropic 股价跌破 83 美元的 IPO 发行价，周二午盘最低跌至 76 美元，较周一收盘下跌近 12%，距其在 Nasdaq 以 111.33 美元上市不到一周。风投界视其为公开市场对 AI 行业估值的晴雨表，若持续走弱可能压低 AI 初创公司私募估值和其他公司 IPO 前景。同日 Nvidia 也跌超 7%。","title":"Anthropic 股价跌破 83 美元 IPO 发行价，上市不到一周最低跌至 76 美元","title_en":"Anthropic shares fall below IPO price, a worrying sign for AI startups","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/24/anthropic-shares-fall-below-ipo-price-a-worrying-sign-for-ai-startups/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ygbhvp086wl672gfxuhfgl23x","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"ygbhvp086wl672gfxuhfgl23x","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ygbhvp086wl672gfxuhfgl23x","published_at":"2026-11-24T12:30:05Z","ref":"A4","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","summary":"Amazon 威胁情报报告称，黑客在开源 AI 渗透测试框架 Cairn 上运行的 AI 智能体，仅凭一句「获取 shell 权限」的指令，就自主发现并利用了一个开源医学影像 AI 应用中未修补的路径遍历 0-day，从映射 API 到任意写文件仅用约 11 分钟，随后写入 Python 反向 shell payload 并以 root 权限获得控制。","title":"Amazon 报告黑客用开源框架 Cairn 驱动 AI 智能体在约 11 分钟内自主发现并利用 0-day","title_en":"Amazon says hackers' AI agents found and exploited 0-day with little human input","url":"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/amazon-says-hackers-ai-agents-found-and-exploited-0-day-with-little-human-input/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/yz5va6l60tfkmdampmsiz0jq2","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"yz5va6l60tfkmdampmsiz0jq2","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/yz5va6l60tfkmdampmsiz0jq2","published_at":"2026-11-24T10:58:57Z","ref":"A5","score":81,"selected":true,"source":"ChinaTalk（RSS）","summary":"作者分析美国 BIS 于 11 月 16 日发布、11 月 19 日生效的租赁算力临时最终规则：向海外数据中心供应芯片、且供中国公司使用超过约 760 张 H100 等值算力的，需申领许可；规则覆盖 Hopper 与 Blackwell 级芯片，并涉及印度尼西亚、马来西亚、新加坡、泰国和巴西的先进 AI 芯片出货，同时关闭 FDD 自认证漏洞。作者基于自建算力模型估算，若规则有效执行，可为中国前沿算力进展带来约六个月的延迟，并指出执法力度与政治意愿是成效关键。","title":"ChinaTalk 分析 BIS 租赁算力新规可为美国换取约六个月算力领先","title_en":null,"url":"https://www.chinatalk.media/p/the-remote-access-rule-will-slow"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","published_at":"2026-11-24T08:15:44Z","ref":"A6","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","summary":"OpenAI 宣布与 Cisco 合作推出开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，让 Agent 编写动态 eBPF 控制来抵御漏洞利用，同时保持服务不中断，为防御方争取测试和部署补丁的时间。作者称这是迈向自适应自防御基础设施的第一步，目标是让防御者与 AI Agent 协作定位受影响系统、测试并共享 shield、在不干扰工作负载的情况下部署。","title":"OpenAI 与 Cisco 发布开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，让 Agent 无停机防御系统","title_en":"We’re working with Cisco on what we think are going to be key infrastructure primitives in the new era of cybersecurity.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2125141302501417232"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","published_at":"2026-11-24T06:12:14Z","ref":"A7","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","summary":"数字生命卡兹克分享自己做产品时用的两个 Prompt，一个按用户体验至上的原则审查项目交互并直接修复，一个把项目动效做到细腻丝滑水准。要点包括让 Gemini 当方案顾问、按状态变化逐项审查动效，完成后让 GPT 审查再合并上线。","title":"卡兹克分享两个优化用户体验和产品动效的 Prompt","title_en":"分享两个最近我自己做产品用来优化用户体验和产品动效的Prompt，我觉得效果还挺不错的。","url":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2125110224143171669"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/f1380j6hyrxn0rnz6666nu3b8","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"f1380j6hyrxn0rnz6666nu3b8","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/f1380j6hyrxn0rnz6666nu3b8","published_at":"2026-11-24T02:11:36Z","ref":"A8","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：MiniMax（稀宇科技）","summary":"MiniMax 推出 H3 Family，包含 H3、H3-Highspeed、H3-Lite、H3-Image、H3-Image Highspeed 等旗舰模型及 fal、Suno、HeyGen、Pika 等伙伴的多个扩展模型。","title":"MiniMax 发布 H3 Family 系列模型，H3 开源百日衍生模型达 1472 个、下载量超 1.48 亿次","title_en":null,"url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Maoz76fZdGNaB7tlIVxWWQ"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/zto0pspydy8330r0bvwqb6j5z","source":"AIHOT"},"category":